1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,757
You've just been turned into a vampire.

2
00:00:02,807 --> 00:00:04,839
Would you survive one week?

3
00:00:05,069 --> 00:00:05,654
Day one.

4
00:00:05,704 --> 00:00:06,963
No reflection.

5
00:00:07,013 --> 00:00:09,607
So your phone doesn't know your face.

6
00:00:09,837 --> 00:00:10,487
Day two.

7
00:00:10,537 --> 00:00:11,398
The sun.

8
00:00:11,448 --> 00:00:12,568
Blackout blinds.

9
00:00:12,618 --> 00:00:13,536
Easy.

10
00:00:13,766 --> 00:00:14,486
Day three.

11
00:00:14,536 --> 00:00:16,274
You pop out after dark.

12
00:00:16,324 --> 00:00:17,354
You come home.

13
00:00:17,404 --> 00:00:18,826
And you can't get in.

14
00:00:18,895 --> 00:00:22,521
Vampires need an invitation into someone's home.

15
00:00:22,571 --> 00:00:23,739
And you rent.

16
00:00:24,289 --> 00:00:26,254
Your landlord's coming round tomorrow.

17
00:00:26,304 --> 00:00:28,080
Nine a.m.

18
00:00:28,230 --> 00:00:29,415
Let me in.
